"Orpheus Velra is Hazel's older brother, an S-rank brat in his thirties with drug troubles."
"His father is Cousin Hugh, an A-rank, and his mother was Hugh's S-rank first wife."
"He has the Velra family tattoo on his ribs and a cabin on the megayacht Libra."
"His F-city mansion backs onto the largest racetrack on the island."
"At a pool party there he traded a stolen Submerger device to Jacob for drugs."
"He was selected at fifteen years fifty-one days, an S-rank made without genetic assistance."
"His mother Lydia is an S-rank Strength Brute."
"He is a thin, dark-haired S-rank Chainer who has wrecked his mind and body since his teens."
"He stole Aulia's Submerger from Libra and sold it, and cannot remember doing so."
"After the flood Aulia knocked him out on her livestream and handed him to the authorities."
"He trades away his recall to sustain mind-altering chains, leaving little for mind readers."
